  "description": "Screen City, where actors can step directly into the world of a movie. There, the universally acknowledged top actor Nam Woo-Ju is constantly being killed off by Woo Ju-Yeon, who invaded the film, and is pushed out of the protagonist role. Unable to help but feel malice towards him, Nam Woo-Joo begins to confront the movie terrorist Woo Ju-Yeon...\n\n *“What the hell is your reason for doing this to me, Woo Ju-Yeon...!”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
